 /// Mirrors `common.is_fast_reboot_enabled`, which reads
 /// `FAST_RESTART_ENABLE_TABLE|system` field `enable` and returns `"true" in <value>`
 /// (a substring test, so any value containing `true` — e.g. `"true"` — enables it).
